    <briefdescription>
<para>A struct to capture parsed pass pipeline names. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A pipeline is defined as a series of names, each of which may in itself recursively contain a nested pipeline. A name is either the name of a pass (e.g. &quot;instcombine&quot;) or the name of a pipeline type (e.g. &quot;cgscc&quot;). If the name is the name of a pass, the InnerPipeline is empty, since passes cannot contain inner pipelines. See <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_pass_builder_1a9ca0e57e6445ab2fe568e53ba29cc0fd" kindref="member">parsePassPipeline()</ref> for a more detailed description of the textual pipeline format. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
